# Root-level env template — for reference only.
#
# The backend and Docker Compose stack each have their own authoritative
# .env files with the real variable names the app reads:
#
#   docker/.env.example     — full stack (Postgres, Mimir, Grafana, Prometheus, backend, frontend)
#   backend/src/config.js   — source of truth for every variable the backend reads
#
# Copy docker/.env.example to docker/.env for local development:
#   cd docker && cp .env.example .env
